SELECT avg(weight) FROM cars_data WHERE YEAR IN (
    SELECT year FROM cars_data GROUP BY year
); 
This query calculates the average weight of cars for each year in the dataset, ensuring that the result includes all years present in the data. The subquery selects distinct years from `cars_data` and then calculates the average weight for each of these years using the main query. The `GROUP BY` clause ensures that the calculation is performed separately for each unique year in the dataset. This approach provides a clear overview of the car weights over time.

